# Local developer secrets for Taskfile tasks. Copy to .env and fill in.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real credentials.
#
# Loaded automatically by Task (see `dotenv:` in Taskfile.yaml).

# GitHub username and a Personal Access Token used to pull the private
# solo-operator chart/images from ghcr.io. Used by:
#   - `task registry:login:ghcr`      (log Helm into ghcr for chart pulls)
#   - `task chart-checksums`          (verify private chart digests)
#   - `task uat:consensus:secrets`     (create the pods' image-pull secret)
#
# The token MUST have the `read:packages` scope AND be able to read the
# `hashgraph` org's packages. Requirements that trip people up:
#   - Use a CLASSIC PAT with `read:packages` — fine-grained tokens usually
#     cannot read org-owned packages.
#   - If the `hashgraph` org enforces SAML SSO, click "Configure SSO" →
#     "Authorize" for this token, or ghcr returns 401/403 even though the
#     token is otherwise valid.
#   - You must have been granted access to the packages (ask an org admin
#     if you get "denied" despite the above).
# Verify quickly:  echo "$GITHUB_ACCESS_TOKEN" | docker login ghcr.io -u "$GITHUB_USER" --password-stdin
GITHUB_USER=
GITHUB_ACCESS_TOKEN=
